M5Stack CSI Kit — license overview / ライセンスの概要

This repository uses two licenses (dual licensing):

  Code  (src/, tests/, scripts/, firmware/ except README files, examples/)
        -> MIT License                       see LICENSE-CODE
  Documents (Markdown files)
        -> Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)
                                             see LICENSE-DOCS

You may use, copy and adapt both, also in research, theses and teaching,
as long as you keep the copyright notice (code) or give credit (documents).

